# Shut down the physical xArm controller through the sole supervised SDK owner.
#
# This is intentionally separate from ROS/component teardown and from the
# ordinary lifecycle primitive service. The owner accepts only the fixed SDK
# system_control(1) operation; no raw system-control or reboot value is exposed.
string request_id
uint64 expected_generation
string confirmation
---
bool permitted
bool attempted
int32 return_code
string reason
uint64 observed_generation
bool process_restart_required
